# Secrets & local agent state (NEVER commit)
.env
.env.*
.envrc
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
auth.json
**/auth.json
# Project-local Nur agent state
.nur/
**/.nur/
credentials*
**/credentials*
secrets*
**/secrets*
# Templates are content, not secrets (verified placeholders only).
!**/.env.example

# Local agent instructions only (never publish to main).
# Scoped to the root: nested AGENTS.md under skills/ are skill-pack docs
# (React Best Practices, Mobile Harness, ...) that must ship with the pack.
/AGENTS.md
.claude/
!skills/**/AGENTS.md
!skills/**/agents.md
!skills/**/credentials/
!skills/**/secrets/

